{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":48336739,"ns":0,"title":"Capella (engineering)","extract":"Capella is an open-source solution for model-based systems engineering (MBSE). Hosted at polarsys.org, this solution provides a process and tooling for graphical modeling of systems, hardware or software architectures, in accordance with the principles and recommendations defined by the Arcadia method.","description":"Software environment for model-based systems engineering","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}